.TH "nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_list_subsystems" 9 "nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_list_subsystems" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_list_subsystems \- Initialize passthru command for Manage Exported NVM Subsystem Receive - List Exported NVM Subsystems
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_list_subsystems
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "__u16 esubid "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_exported_nvm_subsys_list *list "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "esubid" 12
Return Exported NVM Subsystems with an Exported NVM
Subsystem Identifier greater than or equal to this value
.IP "list" 12
User address to store the Exported NVM Subsystems List data
structure, see \fIstruct nvme_exported_nvm_subsys_list\fP
.IP "len" 12
The allocated length of \fIlist\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Manage Exported NVM
Subsystem Receive command with SEL value
NVME_MANAGE_EXPORT_NVMS_RECV_SEL_LIST_SUBSYSTEMS.
